  {
   "kind": "linkedin-post",
   "text": "Anthropic just published a study of its own staff. Juniors went from 27% of its new technical hires to 9%, and many of its managers say AI is why.\n\nCash machines and spreadsheets took the dull bottom of jobs before, and the jobs came back bigger. This time AI takes the first draft, the very work juniors learned on.\n\nTwo questions for your next hiring meeting: who on this team will be a senior in 2030, and what are they learning on today?\n\nThe full deep dive is at makeyourmindup.ai."
